{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8d0bfa94d407874e0557ee33db2e60fb110a76395cf69d2f018c3b657abc437f", "ja": "（今日は風花の写真集の撮影日。中華風な雰囲気に\nこだわったからか、非日常感のある写真が撮れた）", "zh": "（今天是风花写真集的拍摄日。或许是因为我们坚持营造中式氛围，拍出了很有非日常感的照片）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "591c70e06b2808474ffb99511cba94bcf87f80423023f3d6264724037c7dd16d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様でした。\n撮影、どうでしたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n拍摄感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1002_p", "source_sha256": "73a0fad77713b330720803b4cf90a44bcf2a6a83b459a381e910d4a28eeb6b27", "ja": "お疲れ様、風花。ミステリアスな空気が感じられて、\nよかったよ。いい写真集になりそうだ！", "zh": "辛苦了，风花。能感受到神秘的氛围，拍得很不错。看来会成为一本很棒的写真集！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6556a6887be30635d53630b96b2ab83441e76f99821fe3fb6d01f7e52c7de923", "ja": "ふふっ、よかったです。\n雰囲気作りが、うまくいったおかげですね。", "zh": "呵呵，太好了。\n多亏气氛营造得很成功呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1916551d8408181167a1a8f8a5f4eb6239f025fedf4110f469f1a3f11033f558", "ja": "雰囲気作り？", "zh": "营造氛围？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "26f222de34e345538e1710d95cdc7ac42342fda6e3c29c8faaaae917f4806d14", "ja": "はい。建物や衣装、小道具にもこだわりが見えて……\nどういう人物を演じればいいか、やりやすかったです。", "zh": "是的。从建筑、服装到小道具，都能看出他们很用心……\n所以也更容易把握该如何去饰演这个人物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ec3abcd9c32d990d47d02509ed1e547f88e34c65af4f96a2ff53c5ee0a5d4843", "ja": "なるほど、雰囲気作りか。打ち合わせの時も、\nこういう写真にしたいって熱量が違ったからな。", "zh": "原来如此，是在营造氛围啊。开会时也能感受到，想拍出这种照片的热情完全不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "205a881e31aa41bfbb1ff92b83b7b0ad21a3d82c8e31cdddcbc922db88783dea", "ja": "そうなんですね。衣装を見た時に、セクシーな部分に\n目がいってしまって、驚きましたけど……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。我看到服装时，目光不由得被性感的部分吸引了过去，吓了一跳呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3426d5504b24e2e3fcf9ea0ff97a3bfaae54c604e7efe8c21f43c96524ff037b", "ja": "どういう写真に……どんな人物を見せたいかわかると、\nそういう部分も必要なんだなって。", "zh": "知道想通过怎样的照片……展现出怎样的人物形象后，就会明白那种部分也是必不可少的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c2ac5b554b74716535c50aa430a3918b19bd514f53aa113337576cbae4dccde5", "ja": "雰囲気作りのおかげで、早く理解できましたし、\n撮影も、自然体でできたような気がします♪", "zh": "多亏了氛围的营造，我很快就理解了，而且感觉拍摄时也能以自然的状态完成呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1010_se", "source_sha256": "5e9308d45b7fcfaf1d6c22138eeeb36c5b9b66c2d0b772519eba28986abcdf4d", "ja": "ぐぅ～……。", "zh": "咕呜～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1011_p", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fd7ea1c9083273a8ab507f50021f540a38030b798ba535454a52df62c70ffc36", "ja": "あ、す、すみません！　私のお腹の……。\n撮影が終わって、気が緩んじゃって……。", "zh": "啊，不、对不起！是我的肚子……  \n拍摄结束后，一放松下来就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8d9557c9064f797b84e1d9f2e53ef53c55b648f239ae2ce93ff9efe0fa3ebf3f", "ja": "今日は、間食をしないようにしてたんです……。\n撮影の時は、集中してて気にならなくて……。", "zh": "今天我一直忍着没吃零食……。\n拍摄的时候注意力很集中，所以没觉得难受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1014_p", "source_sha256": "866cb524269fafd164ab34cdc53a3c003d26722e89ae9b991e2800a67bd1ffce", "ja": "あっ。もしかして、それで差し入れのお菓子に\n手を付けなかったのか……？", "zh": "啊。难道说，所以才没去碰\n慰劳品点心的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b3f885c74ba678eb9120db47f942246546abe3817728a610a6fc98f7e742ed67", "ja": "はい。素敵な写真集にしたい思いは同じですから。\nまあ、私にできることは、それくらいでしたけど……。", "zh": "是的。因为我们都希望能做出一本精彩的写真集。\n不过，我能做到的也就只有这些了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1016_p", "source_sha256": "258bde34b056bf34de36d57cf28fea2aa0be792d1edd319361a9f3e6e0a23ae9", "ja": "風花……。", "zh": "风花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1017_p", "source_sha256": "918edba67dd0caf77f75b66b48bce17a4a1b21000cbc53564d3ac5061d298ecf", "ja": "よしっ！\n撮影を頑張ってくれたし、中華街で何か食べよう！", "zh": "好！\n风花努力拍摄了这么久，我们去中华街吃点什么吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "680f11c8e49db3c6e9198f97edb39f5061384e83575e38905f5060ebc0178d4b", "ja": "わあ～！　実は、考えてたんです。撮影が終わったら\n思いっきり中華料理を食べようって。", "zh": "哇～！其实，我之前就在想，拍摄结束后\n要痛痛快快地吃一顿中华料理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4b81ebb9e4d738f7186632ad1058a8bdf3857a5a2f72326a175238bad9bb42f0", "ja": "近くに、可奈ちゃんと行ったお店があるんです。\n夜メニューのお料理も、すごく美味しそうで……。", "zh": "附近有一家我和可奈一起去过的店。晚餐菜单上的菜看起来也特别好吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1020_p", "source_sha256": "a95b0fbde5bd66a652a35d5acdcb0606d4d3bbc1a1aae8920693ee1c8c494ee6", "ja": "へえ、そうなのか。\nじゃあ、そこに行ってみよう！", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。\n那我们就去那里看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c8230956d68c075f2850245c0de349332ea6c797a49a585f32d088c9237648e4", "ja": "ふふっ、はい♪\n私、急いで着替えてきますね！", "zh": "呵呵，好呀♪\n我这就赶紧去换衣服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0574_1022_p", "source_sha256": "5eb3923c0d683f09f014d93bf081cf876516e2aa46cc22cc83d94aac4c86304b", "ja": "（風花の努力が詰まった写真集。その頑張りが\n無駄にならないように、俺も宣伝を頑張らないとな！）", "zh": "（这是凝聚了风花努力的写真集。为了不让她的努力白费，我也得努力帮忙宣传才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
